# {{ tiles.short_title }} {{ year }}

The MGRS squares composited in {{ year }}, one item each. Every item carries
twelve single-band Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFFs at 10 m, in that square's own UTM
zone.

This sub-catalog exists to group the year's items for browsing. It holds no
assets of its own and adds no metadata: everything about the pixels is on the
items, and everything about the run that wrote them is in each GeoTIFF's tags.

## Reading it

Do not walk this catalog: one HTTP request per tile, to learn what one range
request already holds. `../items.parquet` covers every year in one file, so
selecting this year is a predicate rather than a different URL. The
[collection README](../README.md) has the worked query.

